[signal]: Alert or customer report
[scope]: Confirm scope and impact
[lead]: Name lead and next update
[mitigate]: Apply a reversible mitigation
[verify]: Verify the user path and dependencies
[monitor]: Monitor through a checkpoint
[close]: Close with evidence and follow-ups
[signal] -> [scope]
[scope] -> [lead]
[lead] -> [mitigate]
[mitigate] -> [verify]
[verify] -> [monitor]: recovered
[verify] --> [scope]: impact continues
[monitor] -> [close]: evidence accepted
